Document.query(query)		<= ownership by ii
       │
       ├──→ Storer.get_chunks()
       │         ↓
       │       chunks
       │         ↓
       ├──→ BM25 retrieval
       │         ↓
       │       top K
       │
       ├──→ Storer.get_embeddings()
       │         ↓
       │       embeddings
       │         ↓
       ├──→ cosine retrieval
       │         ↓
       │       top K
       │
       └──→ RRF
                 ↓
          final ranked chunks



Document.query()
      │
      ├── "Storer, give me chunks."
      ├── "BM25, rank them."
      ├── "Storer, give me embeddings."
      ├── "Dense retriever, rank them."
      └── "RRF, combine these rankings."


1 document
    │
    ├── N chunks
    │      │
    │      └── 1 embedding per chunk
    │
    └── N embeddings (indirectly, through its chunks)
that is
 1 document → N chunks
 1 document → N embeddings
 1 chunk    → 1 embedding

